WEBVTT

00:00:00.200 --> 00:00:05.107
Specific adjectives and sensory details help a reader picture a place or person.

00:00:05.950 --> 00:00:10.843
When reporting a school event, which detail gives time? Answer: Friday morning at

00:00:10.843 --> 00:00:11.219
nine.

00:00:12.033 --> 00:00:16.919
Describe a busy market using sight, sound and movement without repeating adjectives.

00:00:17.783 --> 00:00:20.727
Discuss why: A stated time locates the event.
